FreeRouting 2.0.1
==================

C++/Qt port of the FreeRouting PCB autorouter (GPL-3.0).
No Java runtime.

Build (Qt 5.15 or Qt 6 Widgets):
  Linux:   qmake6  (or qmake) && make
  macOS:   qmake6 && make     (universal arm64+x86_64)
  Windows: qmake && nmake / jom / mingw32-make

The binary is written to bin/freeRouting (bin\freeRouting.exe).
The program loads translations from the translation folder beside that
binary (freeRouting_de, freeRouting_fr, freeRouting_es, freeRouting_it,
freeRouting_ja, freeRouting_ru, freeRouting_zh-CN).

Source of this snapshot: https://freerouting.org
How to compile: see "Building from Source" on that site.
